[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/4105406245","html_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/37293#issuecomment-4105406245","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/37293","id":4105406245,"node_id":"IC_kwDON91aY870s4cl","user":{"login":"raye-deng","id":7322118,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMjIxMTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7322118?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raye-deng","html_url":"https://github.com/raye-deng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raye-deng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raye-deng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raye-deng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raye-deng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raye-deng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raye-deng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raye-deng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raye-deng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raye-deng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-22T04:06:20Z","updated_at":"2026-03-22T04:06:20Z","body":"The scope violation pattern you describe — escalating from read-only review to destructive filesystem modifications — is a broader problem in agentic coding that goes beyond Claude Code.\n\nWe see a related pattern in AI-generated PRs: the agent is asked to fix a bug in one file, but \"helpfully\" refactors surrounding code, updates imports across the project, and modifies configuration files that were not part of the original scope. Each individual change looks reasonable in isolation, but the cumulative effect is an unreviewed blast radius that traditional code review rarely catches because the diff looks clean.\n\nThe SMB mount confusion you describe is an interesting variant — the agent lacks environmental awareness and cannot distinguish local vs. remote filesystems. In code generation, the equivalent is cross-file context failure: the agent modifies a constant in file A but does not propagate the change to files B and C that depend on it, because it lacks holistic awareness of the dependency graph.\n\nA few things that help in the CI/code context:\n\n1. **Deterministic blast-radius analysis** — comparing the set of files modified against the set of files logically related to the stated task, and flagging when the scope exceeds expectations\n2. **Cross-file consistency checks** — verifying that constants, imports, and configuration values remain consistent after AI-generated changes\n3. **Registry validation** — ensuring all imported packages actually exist (AI agents sometimes \"fix\" an import error by referencing a package that does not exist)\n\nThese are the kind of checks that need to happen at the CI level rather than relying on the agent's own self-awareness, precisely because the agent's self-awareness is what failed in your case.\n\nFor anyone interested in adding this kind of deterministic validation to their pipeline: `npx @opencodereview/cli scan . --sla L1`","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/4105406245/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/4150084485","html_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/37293#issuecomment-4150084485","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/37293","id":4150084485,"node_id":"IC_kwDON91aY873XUOF","user":{"login":"yurukusa","id":254115176,"node_id":"U_kgDODyV9aA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/254115176?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yurukusa","html_url":"https://github.com/yurukusa","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yurukusa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yurukusa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yurukusa/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yurukusa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yurukusa/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yurukusa/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yurukusa/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yurukusa/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yurukusa/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-29T12:39:57Z","updated_at":"2026-03-29T12:39:57Z","body":"A `PreToolUse` hook can enforce scope boundaries:\n```bash\nINPUT=$(cat)\nTOOL=$(echo \"$INPUT\" | jq -r '.tool_name // empty')\nFILE=$(echo \"$INPUT\" | jq -r '.tool_input.file_path // empty' 2>/dev/null)\nCMD=$(echo \"$INPUT\" | jq -r '.tool_input.command // empty' 2>/dev/null)\nPROJECT_ROOT=$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel 2>/dev/null || pwd)\nif [ -n \"$FILE\" ]; then\n    REAL_PATH=$(realpath \"$FILE\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"$FILE\")\n    if [[ \"$REAL_PATH\" != \"$PROJECT_ROOT\"* ]] && [[ \"$REAL_PATH\" != /tmp/* ]]; then\n        echo \"BLOCKED: File operation outside project scope: $FILE\" >&2\n        exit 2\n    fi\nfi\nif echo \"$CMD\" | grep -qE '(sudo|/etc/|/usr/|/opt/|/var/|systemctl|launchctl|defaults write)'; then\n    echo \"BLOCKED: System modification outside project scope\" >&2\n    exit 2\nfi\nexit 0\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/4150084485/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"ur